	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  Gestion Utilisateur]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=20036#p20036"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>La colonne &#039;backend_start&#039; va te donner l&#039;heure de début de chaque connexion.<br />&#160; &#160; &#160;select usename, backend_start from pg_stat_activity where datname=&#039;mabase&#039;;</p><p>Pour connaitre le temps d&#039;établissement de la connexion tu peux:<br />&#160; &#160; &#160;select usename, now() - backend_start from pg_stat_activity where datname=&#039;mabase&#039;;<br />Un peu mieux formaté:<br />&#160; &#160; &#160;select usename, to_char(now() - backend_start,&#039;DD HH24:MI:SS&#039;) from pg_stat_activity where datname=&#039;mabase&#039;;</p>]]></content>
